The board camera only draws LAKESIDE_LAYER and WorldFlow hides her for the level, so she vanished at the swap.
The board lease now mounts a copy of her (taken at lease creation, after the landing hook: she has stopped) in
the board scenery at journeyScene^-1 x her world transform = the spot where she landed, same joint pose,
animation/scripts off, board layer. Her own renderers only (the original is hidden during the level); freed
exactly once with the lease. Meadow/sky-city boards never showed her (own-layer cameras). Test:
tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_board_guest.cjs (lakeside-board-guest).
